        "body": "This PR contains the service file for the zenoh router, with `Type=simple`, along with some maintainer scripts ( postinst, and postrm).\r\nLogs are managed also by systemd and can be seen using ` journalctl -u zenoh`.\r\nThis should address #142.\r\n\r\nIdeally, I would like also to update the rmp generation to embed the service file and the postinst/postrm scripts, but I did not find the related metadata in `zenoh/Cargo.toml` ",
